  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Accountant)\n\n### Capium 365: How to Purchase Licenses\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 18 Jul, 2025 at 12:34 PM\n\nPurchasing additional licenses for Capium 365 is quick and seamless. Follow the steps below to manage your subscription and ensure your team has the access they need.\n\nStep-by-Step Guide\n\nNavigation: My Admin > My Subscription > Capium 365\nAlternatively please click on this link to be redirected. \n\nAccess My Admin: From the Capium dashboard, navigate to the top-right corner and select My Admin.\n\nOpen My Subscription: Click on My Subscription to view your current subscription plan.\n\nChoose Capium 365: Under the available options, select Capium 365.\n\nSelect License Quantity: Use the dropdown or input field to choose the number of additional licenses required.\n\nInitiate Payment: Click Pay Now to proceed.\n\nEnter Payment Details: Complete the payment form with your card details and billing information.\n\nOther Recommended Articles\n\nCapium 365: Manage (To get started with using the module) \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118596\">Capium 365</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000200518\">Capium 365 (Accountant)</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Capium 365: How to Purchase Licenses\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 18 Jul, 2025 at 12:34 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<div class=\"fr-draggable\" style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 65.01809408926417%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/e5dd43f1f6c24b3895537fa5b7276765?sid=977b9fa3-70d1-4657-9a16-7d5e8bfde673\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation allow-popups\"></iframe></div><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Purchasing additional licenses for Capium 365 is quick and seamless. Follow the steps below to manage your subscription and ensure your team has the access they need.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p><strong><u>Step-by-Step Guide</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: My Admin &gt; My Subscription &gt; Capium 365<br>Alternatively please click on <a href=\"https://subscription.capium.com/home/products\">this link to be redirected</a>.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Access My Admin</strong>: From the Capium dashboard, navigate to the top-right corner and select My Admin.<br><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234378309/original/DPr-FeU_yI4wnOih9X5tiwYVkUBmwYb18g.png?1752837343\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9234378309\"></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Open My Subscription</strong>: Click on My Subscription to view your current subscription plan.<br><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234378263/original/eOMgl6_j-IlzVNYUJXq67nIjmwYBQYrmpA.png?1752837265\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9234378263\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Choose Capium 365</strong>: Under the available options, select Capium 365.</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234378201/original/3N31Rd-DpZL0Grp9OufrSHnja2Nm5YC4zg.png?1752837154\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9234378201\"><br></p><p><strong>Select License Quantity</strong>: Use the dropdown or input field to choose the number of additional licenses required.</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234378350/original/XqkW4Vtsj7POs9z3aHZ8pe0Ldb1PCOspXg.png?1752837460\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-id=\"9234378350\"></p><p><br></p><p><strong dir=\"ltr\">Initiate Payment</strong>: Click Pay Now to proceed.</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234378424/original/IO3cH8vcMsAU-u03d_EPfClz9kZ1vAc_ug.png?1752837591\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9234378424\"></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Enter Payment Details</strong>: Complete the payment form with your card details and billing information.</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234378452/original/Kz4BlG70zkxvqPWxhEUTLZwEwap11OTHVA.png?1752837632\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9234378452\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><u dir=\"ltr\">Other Recommended Articles</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/9000268727-capium-365-manage\">Capium 365: Manage (To get started with using the module)&nbsp;</a></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br dir=\"ltr\"></span></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000246860\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000246860/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000246860\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000246860/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_